    "details": "Gitlab reports:\n\n> Integer Overflow issue in CI/CD Regular Expression Compiler impacts\n> GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Cross-site Scripting issue in syntax highlighting impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Improper Authorization issue in downstream pipeline creation service\n> impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Permissive Regular Expression issue in repository file access impacts\n> GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in scheduled pipeline execution policy\n> impacts GitLab EE\n>\n> Improper Neutralization of Input Used for LLM Prompting issue in\n> GitLab Duo Agent Platform impacts GitLab EE\n>\n> Sensitive Information Exposure issue in GitLab Pages impacts GitLab\n> CE/EE\n>\n> Open Redirect issue in Kubernetes proxy impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in GraphQL notes widget impacts GitLab\n> CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in GraphQL work item hierarchy impacts\n> GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in GraphQL scope impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Page cache poisoning via improper cache key construction in merge\n> requests impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in work items GraphQL API impacts GitLab\n> CE/EE\n>\n> Missing Authorization issue in merge request accessibility report\n> comparison endpoint impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Privilege Assignment issue in custom roles impacts GitLab EE\n>\n> Insufficient Granularity of Access Control issue in project label\n> management impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Governance Control Bypass issue in Duo Agent Platform impacts GitLab\n> EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in package registry impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in merge request approval eligibility\n> check impacts GitLab EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in fine-grained personal access tokens\n> impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Server Side Request Forgery (SSRF) issue in repository import impacts\n> GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in project import impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Incorrect Authorization issue in Package Registry impacts GitLab CE/EE\n>\n> Improper Access Control issue in project CI/CD settings impacts GitLab\n> EE\n",
